                <span class="trophy" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
                <h3>Stelle della lettura</h3>
                <p><strong class="counter" data-target="1000">0</strong>+ traguardi degli studenti celebrati.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="achieve-card reveal">
                <span class="trophy" aria-hidden="true">⚽</span>
                <h3>Campioni dello sport</h3>
                <p><strong class="counter" data-target="18">0</strong> trofei sportivi in questa stagione.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="achieve-card reveal">
                <span class="trophy" aria-hidden="true">🎨</span>
                <h3>Vincitori d'arte</h3>
